              'Only signed in users can join this meeting.\n\n**This field is deprecated and will not be supported in the future.**  <br><br>As an alternative, use the "meeting_authentication", "authentication_option" and "authentication_domains" fields to understand the [authentication configurations](https://support.zoom.us/hc/en-us/articles/360037117472-Authentication-Profiles-for-Meetings-and-Webinars) set for the Webinar.',
